{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106140","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1910613001:0":{"text":"돌아왔다, 돌아왔어...","source_cn":"回来了，回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B941D65B5D2DE6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910613002:0":{"text":"같이, 같이, 같이...","source_cn":"一起一起一起起起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3BA0A3C8BE3233","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910614001:1":{"text":"어이, 촉수! 저 징그러운 괴물은 뭐야?","source_cn":"触手男，这恶心的怪物是什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB659540068E3033E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910614002:1":{"text":"칼릭스, 저건...","source_cn":"卡律先生，它们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE22FB78A77E00E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910614003:1":{"text":"...<style=\"highlight\">내 가족</style>이다. 적어도 한때는 그랬지.","source_cn":"……<style=highlight2>是我的家人</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE2C43872FE056A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1910614003":{"text":"...<style=\"highlight\">내 가족</style>이다. 적어도 한때는 그랬지.","source_cn":"……<style=highlight2>是我的家人</style>。曾经是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE2C43872FE056A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910614004:1":{"text":"네, 네 가족이라고? 하지만 모습이... 어... 인사라도 해야 할까?","source_cn":"他们、他们是你的家人？但是，但是他们的模样……呃，我是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6387DD88107A04FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910614005:1":{"text":"아, 안녕...?","source_cn":"你们……好……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A7B405F54236D1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910614006:1":{"text":"가까이 가지 말고 물러서라.","source_cn":"退后，不要靠近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x005608004A469BD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910614007:1":{"text":"他们是深岩家族最后的样子。","source_cn":"他们是深岩家族最后的样子。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB61E9965DAA4760B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910614008:1":{"text":"이미 천해족의 냄새와 동족의 피비린내를 맡았다. 곧 사냥을 시작할 거다.","source_cn":"他们已经嗅到了浅海裔的气息和同族的血肉，捕食马上就会开始。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE99AB79D0567F2B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910614009:1":{"text":"너희는 떠나라. 이건 우리 가문의 일이니 내가 직접 처리하지.","source_cn":"你们离开，这是我家的事，我自己处理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5278CA8FA93F367D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910614010:1":{"text":"무슨 사냥? 어이, 촉수! 똑바로 말해!","source_cn":"什么捕食，触手男，你在说什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3360F86E27D9E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910614011:1":{"text":"너도, 나도, 여기 있는 우리 모두 말이다! 먼저 손을 쓰지 않으면 순식간에 저놈들의 촉수에 갈기갈기 찢긴 고깃덩이가 될 거다!","source_cn":"你，我，我们！如果不动手，下一瞬就会变成他们腕足间的碎肉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0128A5EEDB930F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910614012:1":{"text":"그럼 뭘 기다려? 내가...","source_cn":"那还等什么？咱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E7534EDCA46429B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910614013:1":{"text":"...물러서라고 했다!","source_cn":"——都退后！我说了，退后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FBEAB07AAF17DE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910614014:1":{"text":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","source_cn":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDB6B54BFE60498E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1910614014":{"text":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","source_cn":"这是深岩家的事，我的血亲，我自己处理。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDB6B54BFE60498E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910614015:1":{"text":"뭐? 안 돼, 칼릭스!","source_cn":"什么？！不，卡律先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA70E3BF04CB9C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910614016:1":{"text":"건드리면 다 찢어 버리겠다! 내장을 전부 끄집어내고, 창자로 올가미를 만들어 주마!","source_cn":"谁敢碰他们，我就把谁撕碎！！我会把那个人的内脏全部扯出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA61B5DF9CE8F0CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910614017:1":{"text":"알아들었으면 가! 최대한 멀리 떠나라고!","source_cn":"如果你们听懂了，就走，走得越远越好！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588BCA24CC48EB8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1910614017":{"text":"알아들었으면 가! 최대한 멀리 떠나라고!","source_cn":"如果你们听懂了，就走，走得越远越好！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588BCA24CC48EB8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910614018:1":{"text":"...그래, 가자! 톨란, 칼릭스를 방해하지 마. 저 사람들은 칼릭스의 가족이잖아. 나... 나는 이해할 수 있어.","source_cn":"……好，我们走！图澜，不要打扰卡律先生了，那是他的亲族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD67DA49975768CEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910614019:1":{"text":"쯧, 그래. 가자고! 어이, 촉수! 죽지 마라!","source_cn":"啧！成，咱走。但是触手男，你不许死在这儿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651D681A01297530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:1910614020:1":{"text":"뒷걸음질치던 우리는 몸을 돌려 떠났다. 떠나기 직전, 생물들의 목구멍에서 기괴한 울음소리가 흘러나오는 것이 들렸다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10EF867F454AF873","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"뒷걸음질치던 우리는 몸을 돌려 떠났다. 떠나기 직전, 생물들의 목구멍에서 기괴한 울음소리가 흘러나오는 것이 들렸다","female":"뒷걸음질치던 우리는 몸을 돌려 떠났다. 떠나기 직전, 생물들의 목구멍에서 기괴한 울음소리가 흘러나오는 것이 들렸다","variant_male_record_index":"253061","variant_female_record_index":"253062","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:32:1910614021:1":{"text":"웃는 듯 울부짖는 듯한 그 소리는 기쁨에 찬 부름 같기도 하고 고통스러운 신음 같기도 했다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA0004192BB6B5A6E","variant_status